cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "WWII Unit Locations: a claim-based dataset of unit positions (Western Front, 1944)"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0-rc1
date-released: "2026-11-24"
authors:
  - family-names: "Starsman"
    given-names: "Raymond Scott"
    email: "scott@starsman.com"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/scottstarsman/UnitLocationData"
abstract: "Event-based, sourced claims about where World War II units were on given dates, with coordinates, precision, confidence, conflict handling and optional strength figures. Coverage so far: the Western Front, 6 June 1944 to 8 May 1945 (pre-invasion rows under OP-PRE-INVASION), 12,770 claims in 2,635 units across ground, air and naval domains."
keywords:
  - World War II
  - military history
  - order of battle
  - Normandy
  - geospatial
